#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Store Qiskit objects to disk so you can continue where you left off"
msgstr "Simpan objek Qiskit pada cakera atau di awan supaya anda boleh meneruskan dari mana anda berhenti"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Save circuits to disk"
msgstr "Simpan dan ambil semula objek Qiskit"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"guides/save-circuits.ipynb\" />\n"
msgstr "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"guides/save-circuits.ipynb\" />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"{/*\n"
"  DO NOT EDIT THIS CELL!!!\n"
"  This cell's content is generated automatically by a script. Anything you add\n"
"  here will be removed next time the notebook is run. To add new content, create\n"
"  a new cell before or after this one.\n"
"*/}\n"
msgstr ""
"{/*\n"
"  DO NOT EDIT THIS CELL!!!\n"
"  This cell's content is generated automatically by a script. Anything you add\n"
"  here will be removed next time the notebook is run. To add new content, create\n"
"  a new cell before or after this one.\n"
"*/}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Package versions\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Versi pakej\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The code on this page was developed using the following requirements.\n"
"We recommend using these versions or newer.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kod pada halaman ini dibangunkan menggunakan keperluan berikut.\n"
"Kami mengesyorkan penggunaan versi ini atau yang lebih baharu.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"Use [QPY serialization](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qpy) to save your circuit to file. QPY files store the full Qiskit circuit object and will be compatible with newer versions of Qiskit (although not necessarily with older versions of Qiskit).\n"
msgstr ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"Gunakan [pensirian QPY](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qpy) untuk menyimpan Circuit anda ke fail. Fail QPY menyimpan objek Circuit Qiskit penuh dan akan serasi dengan versi Qiskit yang lebih baharu (walaupun tidak semestinya dengan versi Qiskit yang lebih lama).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To demonstrate, the following cell creates a simple quantum circuit.\n"
msgstr "Untuk menunjukkan, sel berikut mencipta Circuit kuantum yang mudah.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To save this file to disk, use the `qpy.dump` function. You can also save a list of circuits.\n"
msgstr "Untuk menyimpan fail ini ke cakera, gunakan fungsi `qpy.dump`. Anda juga boleh menyimpan senarai Circuit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This circuit is now saved to the file `test.qpy`. If you restart your Python kernel, you can re-load the circuit using the `qpy.load` function. Note that this always returns a list of circuits, even if you only serialized one circuit.\n"
msgstr "Circuit ini kini disimpan ke fail `test.qpy`. Jika anda memulakan semula kernel Python anda, anda boleh memuatkan semula Circuit menggunakan fungsi `qpy.load`. Perhatikan bahawa ini sentiasa mengembalikan senarai Circuit, walaupun anda hanya mensiri satu Circuit.\n"

